{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iron Revenge 3D</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, intense retro first-person shooter about violence, orders, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Revenge 3D is a tightly focused singleplayer FPS with 30 short missions set in tight, maze-like corridors and brutalist interiors. The gameplay is fast and minimal - no upgrades, no crafting, no filler. Just you, a weapon, and the next objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfights are quick and punishing. Ammo is limited. Every shot has weight. Between missions, short bursts of dialogue tell a grounded story about loyalty, betrayal, and the cost of following orders. You can skip the dialogue entirely - or pay attention and see what\u2019s really going on beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No meta-progression. No collectibles. No filler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a sharp, two-hour experience for players who miss when shooters respected their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iron Revenge 3D is a fictional work inspired by real-world conflicts. It does not endorse any group or ideology.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739900?t=1770123427","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739900?t=1770123427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739900/46eebf3a52589594ce1d1d2e11ac449cb7bc8636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770123427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739900/46eebf3a52589594ce1d1d2e11ac449cb7bc8636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770123427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore, References to real life terrorist organizations."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iron Revenge 3D</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, intense retro first-person shooter about violence, orders, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Revenge 3D is a tightly focused singleplayer FPS with 30 short missions set in tight, maze-like corridors and brutalist interiors. The gameplay is fast and minimal - no upgrades, no crafting, no filler. Just you, a weapon, and the next objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfights are quick and punishing. Ammo is limited. Every shot has weight. Between missions, short bursts of dialogue tell a grounded story about loyalty, betrayal, and the cost of following orders. You can skip the dialogue entirely - or pay attention and see what\u2019s really going on beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No meta-progression. No collectibles. No filler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a sharp, two-hour experience for players who miss when shooters respected their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iron Revenge 3D is a fictional work inspired by real-world conflicts. It does not endorse any group or ideology.</i></p>","developers":["Steelbyte Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739900/d7073a52d47d157b86ab03961f3587112af6ee5b/header.jpg?t=1770123427","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3739900/740682473/d392df29ae3fa337286c043f89905ea6190415c0/1752663147/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752770629","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3739900/740682473/d392df29ae3fa337286c043f89905ea6190415c0/1752663147/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752770629","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra